 However, here we make a distinction between quality control and feature selection. Removing biologically uninteresting genes (such as mitochondrial genes) may also be considered as part of feature selection, since there is no underlying experimental procedure that has failed. Therefore, we will discuss gene-level filtering in @sec-seq-processing.
 
